flowchart LR
    CLI[csdlc-github-issue\nrun --request] --> PARSE[Typed request validation]
    PARSE --> OCTO[Existing Octocrab client]
    OCTO --> FETCH[fetch_issue_value\nstructured Octocrab result]
    FETCH --> CALLER{Caller}
    CALLER -->|Explicit IssueRead success| NORMALIZE[Existing normalize_issue]
    NORMALIZE --> SUCCESS[Existing GithubIssuePacket\nunchanged JSON and exit 0]
    CALLER -->|Explicit IssueRead error| CLASSIFY[Issue-read failure classifier]
    CALLER -->|Create update comment close readback| SHARED[Existing read_issue_packet]
    SHARED -->|error| GENERIC[Existing remote_failure]
    SHARED -->|success| NORMALIZE

    CLASSIFY --> N404[404\nremote_not_found\nexit 69]
    CLASSIFY --> AUTH[401 or ordinary 403\nremote_authentication or authorization\nexit 77]
    CLASSIFY --> RATE[rate 403 or 429\nremote_rate_limited\nexit 74]
    CLASSIFY --> SERVER[5xx\nremote_server\nexit 74]
    CLASSIFY --> TRANSPORT[service HTTP Hyper connection\nremote_transport\nexit 74]
    CLASSIFY --> OTHER[unclassified\nremote_failure\nexit 74]

    N404 --> SAFE[csdlc.error.v1 on stdout]
    AUTH --> SAFE
    RATE --> SAFE
    SERVER --> SAFE
    TRANSPORT --> SAFE
    OTHER --> SAFE
    GENERIC --> SAFE

    SAFE --> REDACT[Only owner/name and issue N\nNo token path value header or raw body]
    TEST[Loopback binary proof\n200 404 401 403 429 500 dropped connection] -. verifies .-> SUCCESS
    TEST -. verifies .-> REDACT
    TEST -. verifies non-read compatibility .-> GENERIC
